<title>UK: Ford Motor Credit sets 250 million mark bond.</title>
<headline>Ford Motor Credit sets 250 million mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD MOTOR CREDIT CO</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    20.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.87    PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.62     SPREAD	+40 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 122 OBL</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
